---
description: >-
  BT gitGraph with a branch x and a sub-branch y of x, where neither is checked out immediately
  after being declared, followed by merges of x into main and y into x — testing deferred usage of
  nested sub-branches.
---
gitGraph BT:
  commit id:"1-abcdefg"
  branch x
  checkout main
  commit id:"2-abcdefg"
  checkout x
  commit id:"3-abcdefg"
  checkout main
  merge x
  checkout x
  branch y
  checkout x
  commit id:"4-abcdefg"
  checkout y
  commit id:"5-abcdefg"
  checkout x
  merge y
